WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.682
To follow your day without opening the app
each time, open Settings, then
Notifications.

00:00:06.532 --> 00:00:08.179
Turn on Show Live Activities.

00:00:09.379 --> 00:00:13.476
If they don't appear, check that iOS allows
Live Activities for RosterEase as well.

00:00:14.776 --> 00:00:16.555
Open RosterEase when your work day starts.

00:00:17.355 --> 00:00:20.626
The activity can show your shift, or your
progress through visits.

00:00:21.476 --> 00:00:22.780
It may not appear on a day off.

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:26.170
For a long day, reopen the app to refresh
it.

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:30.815
And if you don't want the details visible,
hide Live Activity details in Privacy.
